Text styling. Rendered on the C64 only;
plain everywhere else.
plain italic plain
plain oblique plain
plain bold plain
plain bold italic plain
plain monospace plain
plain serif, so unstyled plain
Nested: the inner class clears one bit
and must leave the other alone.
bold normal bold
italic upright italic
both italic only both
